# ---- Build output ----
# N.B. we DO NOT ignore *.lib / *.dll / *.a globally, because we commit the prebuilt
# libraries (GLFW, Assimp, ...) inside libs/ and external/ (strategy A). The compiler
# output of those types ends up inside build/ (or bin/, Debug/, ...) which are ignored
# as whole folders below, so we don't lose anything by removing the extension rules.
build/
out/
bin/
Debug/
Release/
x64/
x86/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.o
*.exe
*.pdb
# NB: we do NOT ignore *.obj: Wavefront model files (assets/models/*.obj) must be committed.
# Compiler object files of that type live inside build/ (ignored as a whole folder) anyway.
*.ilk
*.exp
*.idb

# ---- CMake ----
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
_deps/
*.cmake.stamp

# ---- Visual Studio ----
.vs/
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.iml
*.vcxproj.user
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
ipch/
*.aps
*.ncb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.cachefile

# ---- Visual Studio Code ----
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ---- JetBrains (CLion) ----
.idea/
cmake-build-*/

# ---- Dependencies ----
# We commit the libraries into the repo (strategy A): external/ (headers + glad/imgui
# source) and libs/win/ (prebuilt .lib/.dll). We only ignore the compressed archives we
# might download before extracting them.
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz

# ---- Assets / captures (optional, decommenta se pesanti) ----
# assets/**/*.fbx
# captures/
# *.mp4

# ---- Logs / benchmark output ----
# The benchmark writes into benchmarks/. The CSV runs are throwaway (regenerated any time by
# replaying a path), so we ignore them; the recorded walkthroughs (benchmarks/*_path.txt) ARE
# committed, as the reproducible reference paths. "benchmark_*.csv" has no leading slash, so it
# matches in benchmarks/ too.
logs/
*.log
benchmark_*.csv

# ---- OS ----
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ---- Altri file ----
work_division.md
M1_notes.md
M2_notes.md
content_notes.md
tooling_notes.md
M2_shadows_plan.md
M3_notes.md
analysis_notes.md